-- SURROGATE LEWA7DO ------------------------------------- main.franco.kl  K0132

`\u{D800}` nos surrogate pair f UTF-16, w da mesh 7arf lewa7do. Strings Kalam feeha 7oroof Unicode kamla.

10│     ektb("total \u{D800} {n}")
                    ^^^^^^^^

